Code differences of the Japanese HeartGold and SoulSilver cartridges from US,
applied after heartgold-mail-template.patch.

- The start menu also lists its actions as text in a window on the top screen.
  The window, its 2D list menu and the list items live at the start of the
  menu's data, and closing or leaving the menu removes them.
- Opening the Bag does not call ov01_021F4440.
- The game-reset check has no case for result 5.
- A finished flash write unlocks the card before looking at the result, and
  asserts on an unexpected one.

